{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digifilter",
 "version": "1.0i",
 "title": "Digi Filter",
 "description": "Adds per-track filter modes to the Digitakt mk1 on top of the stock LP/HP/EQ, using each track's own FREQ, RESO and filter envelope: BP (band pass), BP2 (a wider band pass), COMB and TRASH (two combs). Widens the Filter Type range to 11 and renames the new values, and runs the extra DSP at the per-voice filter call (site 0x400780ba -> digifilter_dispatch). Stock TYPE values tail-call the stock filter untouched. While COMB/TRASH is selected the second FLTR page's Base/Width/Env Delay/SRR knobs become delay/harmonics/damping/feedback trim. WIP: the FLTR page's FREQ/RES response curve still draws the stock shapes for the new types. See README.md.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitakt-mk1",
  "product": "Digitakt mk1",
